# INVWIN2.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: Items > Service,
# the recent service list in the frame.  ENTER shows record 1 in view
# mode, which OK closes; CTRL+E edits it, and its summary saved shows in the
# list fetched again; INS does nothing; DEL asks first, its default
# answer No: N keeps the record, Y deletes it and the list fetched again
# is empty; ESC goes back to the item list; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWIN2.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I E
S RECENT
K ENTER
S VIEW
K ENTER
S VIEWOK
# the focus starts on the date: TAB to the type, TAB to the summary
K CTRL-E
S EDIT
K TAB TAB
T Recapped and tested the power supply
S TYPED
K ENTER
S SAVED
K INS
S NOINS
K DEL
S ASK
K N
S KEPT
K DEL Y
S DELETED
K ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F X
